        "description": "Presence of pathogenic TNFRSF1A gene mutation",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of recurrent fever episodes plus either a pathogenic TNFRSF1A mutation or at least one major clinical criterion",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential for confirmation; clinical presentation can be variable."
